      "findings": [
        "Corrected paclitaxel-only haematological actions previously applied to whole regimen.",
        "Added the ≥7-day duration condition to profound neutropenia; visually verified the merged Table 2 cell also applies delay/one-level reduction after recovery to febrile neutropenia, alongside considering G-CSF.",
